  "title": "Deviled Smoked Ham Spread",
  "description": "Smoked boneless ham and hard-cooked eggs with plenty of sweet pickle relish make up this old-fashioned sweet and tangy ham salad that's made with a food grinder. Serve on crackers or use to fill sandwiches.",
